{"id":"36754a003d184a02","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-cofinal-branch.md","title":"Cofinal Branch","display":"thm-cofinal-branch — Cofinal Branch","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-cofinal-branch","aliases":["58-thm-cofinal-branch"],"display":"thm-cofinal-branch — Cofinal Branch","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-cofinal-branch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-cofinal-branch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cofinal-branch — Cofinal Branch"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md\">../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ddaf9aa303e4aaf7\" href=\"?note=ddaf9aa303e4aaf7\" title=\"58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree\">58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,&lt;_{T})\">\\((T,&lt;_{T})\\)</span> (a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S,\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S,\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S,\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S,\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S\\)</span> (typed predicates from the displayed dependencies)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cofinal-branch}\\vdash{}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists b\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\bigr)\\lor\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists b\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cofinal-branch}\\vdash{}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists b\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\bigr)\\lor\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\neg\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists b\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,&lt;_{T},\\kappa)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The exclusive alternative is expanded with ordinary connectives: an Aronszajn <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree is precisely a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree with no cofinal branch.</li>\n<li>No unnecessary hypothesis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T|=\\kappa\">\\(|T|=\\kappa\\)</span> is added beyond the typed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-tree predicate.</li>\n<li>The tree and branch predicates now come from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md\">../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md</a>, while the generalized Aronszajn predicate comes from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ddaf9aa303e4aaf7\" href=\"?note=ddaf9aa303e4aaf7\" title=\"58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree\">58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree</a>; the former tree/branch links did not define the symbols used in the assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree","status":"resolved","id":"ddaf9aa303e4aaf7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The tree and branch predicates now come from [[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]], while the generalized Aronszajn predicate comes from [[58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree]]; the former tree/branch links did not define the symbols used in the assertion.","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree","status":"resolved","id":"ddaf9aa303e4aaf7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The tree and branch predicates now come from [[../batch17/58-df-tree-property.md]], while the generalized Aronszajn predicate comes from [[58-df-zfc-aronszajn-tree]]; the former tree/branch links did not define the symbols used in the assertion.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"(T,<_{T})","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S,\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S,\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cofinal-branch}\\vdash{}\n&\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,<_{T},\\kappa)\\to\\\\\n&\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists b\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,<_{T},\\kappa)\\bigr)\\lor\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,<_{T},\\kappa)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\neg\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\exists b\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,<_{T},\\kappa)\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{AronszajnTree}_S(T,<_{T},\\kappa)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"|T|=\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1582,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4085","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-cofinal-branch.md|58-thm-cofinal-branch]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["e72a83d57cf9c8fb","ddaf9aa303e4aaf7","0fbfc19800246e77"]}